## Lifecycle Management

### Installation Workflow

#### Complete Installation Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin
    participant Blueprint
    participant InstallPB as Install Playbook
    participant StoragePB as Storage Playbook
    participant ConfigPB as Configure Playbook
    participant Role as sp_server_install Role
    participant Module as sp_server Module
    participant Target as Target Server

    Admin->>Admin: Establish password less authentication between client nodes and managed nodes
    Admin->>Admin: create inventory file with node detail<br/>server nodes<br/>client nodes<br/>HSM nodes
    Admin->>Blueprint: ansible-playbook petascale_deployment_blueprint.yml
    
    Note over Blueprint: Phase 1: Installation
    Blueprint->>InstallPB: Execute installation
    InstallPB->>Role: Invoke sp_server_install role
    
    Role->>Target: Pre-checks (OS, hardware, disk)
    Target-->>Role: Validation passed
    
    Role->>Module: Call sp_server.py (state=present)
    Module->>Target: Create user/group (tsminst1)
    Module->>Target: Install IBM Installation Manager
    Module->>Target: Install SP Server packages
    Module->>Target: Initialize server instance
    Target-->>Module: Installation complete
    Module-->>Role: Success
    
    Role->>Target: Post-checks (service, connectivity)
    Target-->>Role: Verification passed
    Role-->>InstallPB: Phase 1 complete
    
    Note over Blueprint: Phase 2: Storage Preparation
    Blueprint->>StoragePB: Execute storage preparation
    StoragePB->>Role: Invoke storage_prepare role
    
    Role->>Target: Discover disks
    Role->>Target: Create volume groups (large)
    Role->>Target: Create logical volumes (500+ TB)
    Role->>Target: Create filesystems
    Role->>Target: Mount filesystems
    Role->>Target: Set permissions
    Target-->>Role: Storage ready
    Role-->>StoragePB: Phase 2 complete
    
    Note over Blueprint: Phase 3: Configuration
    Blueprint->>ConfigPB: Execute configuration
    ConfigPB->>Role: Invoke sp_server_install role
    
    Role->>Module: Call sp_server_configure.py
    Module->>Target: Configure server (large settings)
    Module->>Target: Create storage pools (petascale)
    Module->>Target: Define policies
    Module->>Target: Create schedules
    Module->>Target: Tune performance parameters
    Target-->>Module: Configuration applied
    Module-->>Role: Success
    
    Role->>Target: Final validation
    Target-->>Role: All checks passed
    Role-->>ConfigPB: Phase 3 complete
    
    ConfigPB-->>Blueprint: Deployment complete
    Blueprint-->>Admin: Petascale server ready
```

### Upgrade Workflow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin
    participant UpgradePB as Upgrade Playbook
    participant Role as sp_server_install Role
    participant Module as sp_server Module
    participant Target as Target Server
    participant Backup as Backup Storage
    
    Admin->>UpgradePB: ansible-playbook sp_server_upgrade_playbook.yml
    
    Note over UpgradePB: Pre-Upgrade Phase
    UpgradePB->>Role: Invoke sp_server_install role
    Role->>Module: Call sp_server_facts.py
    Module->>Target: Query current version
    Target-->>Module: Version 8.1.23.0
    Module-->>Role: Current state collected
    
    Role->>Target: Validate upgrade path (8.1.23 -> 8.1.27)
    Target-->>Role: Upgrade path valid
    
    Role->>Target: Check disk space
    Target-->>Role: Sufficient space available
    
    Role->>Module: Call sp_server.py (backup config)
    Module->>Target: Backup server configuration
    Target->>Backup: Save configuration files
    Backup-->>Target: Backup complete
    Target-->>Module: Configuration backed up
    
    Note over UpgradePB: Upgrade Execution Phase
    Role->>Module: Call sp_server.py (state=upgrade)
    Module->>Target: Stop server services
    Target-->>Module: Services stopped
    
    Module->>Target: Extract upgrade packages
    Target-->>Module: Packages extracted
    
    Module->>Target: Run IBM IM upgrade
    Target-->>Module: Packages upgraded
    
    Module->>Target: Migrate database schema
    Target-->>Module: Database migrated
    
    Module->>Target: Update configuration files
    Target-->>Module: Configuration updated
    
    Module->>Target: Start server services
    Target-->>Module: Services started
    
    Note over UpgradePB: Post-Upgrade Validation
    Role->>Module: Call sp_server_facts.py
    Module->>Target: Query new version
    Target-->>Module: Version 8.1.27.0
    
    Role->>Target: Verify service status
    Target-->>Role: All services running
    
    Role->>Target: Test database connectivity
    Target-->>Role: Database accessible
    
    Role->>Target: Validate configuration
    Target-->>Role: Configuration valid
    
    Role-->>UpgradePB: Upgrade successful
    UpgradePB-->>Admin: Server upgraded to 8.1.27.0
```

### Uninstall Workflow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin
    participant UninstallPB as Uninstall Playbook
    participant Role as sp_server_install Role
    participant Module as sp_server Module
    participant Target as Target Server
    participant Storage as Storage System
    
    Admin->>UninstallPB: ansible-playbook sp_server_uninstall_playbook.yml
    
    Note over UninstallPB: Pre-Uninstall Phase
    UninstallPB->>Role: Invoke sp_server_install role
    Role->>Module: Call sp_server_facts.py
    Module->>Target: Query installation status
    Target-->>Module: Server installed
    Module-->>Role: Installation confirmed
    
    Role->>Admin: Confirm uninstallation (if interactive)
    Admin-->>Role: Confirmed
    
    Note over UninstallPB: Backup Phase (Optional)
    Role->>Module: Backup configuration
    Module->>Target: Export server configuration
    Target-->>Module: Configuration exported
    
    Note over UninstallPB: Uninstall Execution Phase
    Role->>Module: Call sp_server.py (state=absent)
    Module->>Target: Stop all server services
    Target-->>Module: Services stopped
    
    Module->>Target: Halt server instance
    Target-->>Module: Instance halted
    
    Module->>Target: Run IBM IM uninstall
    Target-->>Module: Packages uninstalled
    
    Module->>Target: Remove installation directories
    Target-->>Module: Directories removed
    
    Module->>Target: Remove user/group (optional)
    Target-->>Module: User/group removed
    
    Note over UninstallPB: Storage Cleanup (Optional)
    alt clean_up == true
        Role->>Storage: Unmount filesystems
        Storage-->>Role: Filesystems unmounted
        
        Role->>Storage: Remove logical volumes
        Storage-->>Role: LVs removed
        
        Role->>Storage: Remove volume groups
        Storage-->>Role: VGs removed
    end
    
    Note over UninstallPB: Post-Uninstall Validation
    Role->>Target: Verify services removed
    Target-->>Role: No services found
    
    Role->>Target: Verify directories removed
    Target-->>Role: Directories cleaned
    
    Role-->>UninstallPB: Uninstall complete
    UninstallPB-->>Admin: Server successfully uninstalled
```

